.* root directory of this project.
.*
.* The problem log: WRKPRB, its options (DSPPRB's details, Work with
.* Problem, Enter text) and ANZPRB's guided analysis. No pub400 golden:
.* pub400 refuses the commands; ours are under ui/uim/tests/golden/service.
:PNLGRP.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE=ACTION.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=SELCL BASETYPE='CHAR 2'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=IDCL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=STSCL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=TEXTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 50'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NOTECL BASETYPE='CHAR 70'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=SYMPCL BASETYPE='CHAR 60'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=SHORTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 8'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=YNCL BASETYPE='CHAR 1'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OPT CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=OPTION CLASS=SELCL.
:VAR NAME=PRBID CLASS=IDCL.
:VAR NAME=PRBSTS CLASS=STSCL.
:VAR NAME=PRBTEXT CLASS=TEXTCL.
:VAR NAME=PRBTYPE CLASS=YNCL.
:VAR NAME=PRBSEV CLASS=YNCL.
:VAR NAME=PRBREF CLASS=IDCL.
:VAR NAME=PRBRSRC CLASS=IDCL.
:VAR NAME=PRBSYS CLASS=SHORTCL.
:VAR NAME=PRBODATE CLASS=SHORTCL.
:VAR NAME=PRBOTIME CLASS=SHORTCL.
:VAR NAME=PRBCDATE CLASS=SHORTCL.
:VAR NAME=PRBCTIME CLASS=SHORTCL.
:VAR NAME=PRBASGN CLASS=IDCL.
:VAR NAME=PRBSYMP CLASS=SYMPCL.
:VAR NAME=PRBRPT CLASS=SHORTCL.
:VAR NAME=NOTE CLASS=NOTECL.
:VAR NAME=NEWNOTE CLASS=NOTECL.
:VAR NAME=ANZMSGID CLASS=SHORTCL.
:VAR NAME=ANZOBJ CLASS=IDCL.
:VAR NAME=ANZSTOP CLASS=YNCL.
:VAR NAME=ANZTEXT CLASS=TEXTCL.
:LISTDEF NAME=PRBS VARS='OPT PRBID PRBSTS PRBTEXT'.
:LISTDEF NAME=NOTES VARS='NOTE'.
:KEYL NAME=PBKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F5 ACTION='RETURN 5'.F5=Refresh
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F16 ACTION='RETURN 16'.F16=Report prepared problems
:EKEYL.
:KEYL NAME=DSKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:EKEYL.
:KEYL NAME=MNKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=WRKPRB KEYL=PBKEYS HELP=WRKPRB ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Work with Problems
:TOPINST.Type options, press Enter.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=PRBS.(No problems logged)
:LISTACT OPTION=2 ENTER='RETURN 2'.2=Change
:LISTACT OPTION=4 ENTER='RETURN 4'.4=Delete
:LISTACT OPTION=5 ENTER='RETURN 5'.5=Display details
:LISTACT OPTION=6 ENTER='RETURN 6'.6=Print details
:LISTACT OPTION=8 ENTER='RETURN 8'.8=Work with problem
:LISTACT OPTION=9 ENTER='RETURN 9'.9=Work with alerts
:LISTACT OPTION=12 ENTER='RETURN 12'.12=Enter text
:LISTCOL VAR=OPT USAGE=INPUT.Opt
:LISTCOL VAR=PRBID USAGE=OUTPUT.Problem ID
:LISTCOL VAR=PRBSTS USAGE=OUTPUT.Status
:LISTCOL VAR=PRBTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT.Problem Description
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=DSPPRB KEYL=DSKEYS HELP=DSPPRB ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Display Problem Details
:DATA DEPTH=15.
:DATAI VAR=PRBID USAGE=OUTPUT.Problem ID
:DATAI VAR=PRBSTS USAGE=OUTPUT.Status
:DATAI VAR=PRBTYPE USAGE=OUTPUT.Problem type
:DATAI VAR=PRBSEV USAGE=OUTPUT.Severity
:DATAI VAR=PRBTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT.Description
:DATAI VAR=PRBREF USAGE=OUTPUT.Reference code
:DATAI VAR=PRBRSRC USAGE=OUTPUT.Resource name
:DATAI VAR=PRBSYS USAGE=OUTPUT.Origin system
:DATAI VAR=PRBODATE USAGE=OUTPUT.Date opened
:DATAI VAR=PRBOTIME USAGE=OUTPUT.Time opened
:DATAI VAR=PRBCDATE USAGE=OUTPUT.Date last changed
:DATAI VAR=PRBCTIME USAGE=OUTPUT.Time last changed
:DATAI VAR=PRBASGN USAGE=OUTPUT.Assigned to
:DATAI VAR=PRBRPT USAGE=OUTPUT.Report prepared
:DATAI VAR=PRBSYMP USAGE=OUTPUT.Symptom string
:EDATA.
:LIST DEPTH='*' LISTDEF=NOTES.(No notes)
:LISTCOL VAR=NOTE USAGE=OUTPUT.Notes
:ELIST.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=WRKPRBW KEYL=MNKEYS HELP=WRKPRBW ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Work with Problem
:DATA DEPTH=3.
:DATAI VAR=PRBID USAGE=OUTPUT.Problem ID
:DATAI VAR=PRBSTS USAGE=OUTPUT.Status
:DATAI VAR=PRBTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT.Problem
:EDATA.
:MENU DEPTH='*' OPTIONS=OPTION.Select one of the following:
:MENUI OPTION=1 ACTION='RETURN 101'.Analyze problem
:MENUI OPTION=2 ACTION='RETURN 102'.Report problem
:MENUI OPTION=3 ACTION='RETURN 103'.Display problem details
:MENUI OPTION=4 ACTION='RETURN 104'.Enter text about the problem
:MENUI OPTION=5 ACTION='RETURN 105'.Close problem
:EMENU.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=PRBNOTE KEYL=MNKEYS HELP=PRBNOTE ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Enter Text About the Problem
:DATA DEPTH=2.
:DATAI VAR=PRBID USAGE=OUTPUT.Problem ID
:DATAI VAR=PRBTEXT USAGE=OUTPUT.Problem
:EDATA.
:TOPINST.Type text, press Enter.
:DATA DEPTH='*'.
:DATAI VAR=NEWNOTE USAGE=INOUT CSRLOC.Text
:EDATA.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=ANZPRB1 KEYL=MNKEYS HELP=ANZPRB1 ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Analyze a New Problem
:MENU DEPTH='*' OPTIONS=OPTION.Select the area the problem is in:
:MENUI OPTION=1 ACTION='RETURN 201'.A job or program ended, looped or waited
:MENUI OPTION=2 ACTION='RETURN 202'.A message was shown
:MENUI OPTION=3 ACTION='RETURN 203'.A display, printer, tape, optical or disk device
:MENUI OPTION=4 ACTION='RETURN 204'.Communications or a remote system
:MENUI OPTION=5 ACTION='RETURN 205'.Performance
:EMENU.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=ANZPRB2 KEYL=MNKEYS HELP=ANZPRB2 ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Describe the Problem
:TOPINST.Type choices, press Enter.
:DATA DEPTH='*'.
:DATAI VAR=ANZMSGID USAGE=INOUT CSRLOC.Message identifier
:DATAI VAR=ANZOBJ USAGE=INOUT.Job, program, device or line
:DATAI VAR=ANZSTOP USAGE=INOUT.Stops your work (Y, N)
:DATAI VAR=ANZTEXT USAGE=INOUT.Description
:EDATA.
:EPANEL.
:PANEL NAME=ANZPRB3 KEYL=MNKEYS HELP=ANZPRB3 ENTER='RETURN 0' TOPSEP=SYSNAM.Problem Analysis Complete
:DATA DEPTH=3.
:DATAI VAR=PRBID USAGE=OUTPUT.Problem ID
:DATAI VAR=PRBSTS USAGE=OUTPUT.Status
:DATAI VAR=PRBSYMP USAGE=OUTPUT.Symptom string
:EDATA.
:TOPINST.Press Enter to continue.
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=WRKPRB.Work with Problems - Help
:P.The problems the system logged on its own (severe operator messages,
hardware failures, dumps) and the ones problem analysis created, newest
first. Option 8 analyzes one or reports it to the service provider.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=DSPPRB.Display Problem Details - Help
:P.Everything the problem log holds of one problem: where it came from,
its status, the symptom string analysis built, and the notes added to it.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=WRKPRBW.Work with Problem - Help
:P.Analysis marks an opened problem ready to report. Reporting prepares
the report the service provider receives; with no connection to one, the
report is kept and the problem stays prepared.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=PRBNOTE.Enter Text - Help
:P.The text is added to the problem's notes and goes with its report.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=ANZPRB1.Analyze a New Problem - Help
:P.Choose the area that best fits what went wrong. The next panel asks
for what identifies it.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=ANZPRB2.Describe the Problem - Help
:P.Give the message identifier when a message was shown, and the job,
program, device or line involved. The description is the problem's text.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=ANZPRB3.Problem Analysis Complete - Help
:P.The problem is in the problem log, ready to report. WRKPRB shows it.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
